cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "fl_ppml: privacy-preserving federated learning with HE, ZKP and DP on Flower (archived monorepo)"
message: >-
  This repository is archived. To cite the software as it is maintained now,
  cite ppflx, the proof service, or the benchmarks (listed under references).
  Cite this repository for the work as it stood up to the 2026-09-16 split.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "CorpiXo"
    # Add the individual author entry here (given-names / family-names / orcid)
    # so academic citations name a person as well as the organisation.
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-16"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TxCorpi0x/fl_ppml"
url: "https://github.com/CorpiXo/ppflx"
keywords:
  - federated learning
  - homomorphic encryption
  - zero-knowledge proofs
  - differential privacy
  - Flower
abstract: >-
  A framework and benchmark for privacy-preserving federated learning that
  combines homomorphic encryption, Groth16 zero-knowledge proofs of bounded
  model updates, and differential privacy, with an on-chain audit ledger. On
  2026-09-16 this monorepo was split into a library, a proof service and a
  benchmark harness, each carrying the history of its files; development
  continues there. This repository remains the record of the combined history
  and of the benchmark results produced before the split.
